{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/capsule_small__3_.png?t=1740932475\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Note for the demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>1) It's in development, some details may look unpolished or cheap (pausemenu, settings menu)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>2) I forgot to delete the save, it'll be removed in a future demo update.<br>&gt; Click &quot;new game&quot; in the first launch.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>3) The settings menu is not yet functioning.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Also <strong>don't forget to feedback</strong>, it's <strong>genuinely helping</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&gt; I have a Discord server dedicated to the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Introducing, Ruby Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ruby Journey</strong> is an immersive sim taking place <strong>in a village</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You arrive with just <strong>one</strong>\u00a0<strong>gold</strong>, and you want their <strong>ruby</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade, do quests, manage your resources wisely to get richer...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to PNJs and grow friendships, all while discovering their lore...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/page.png?t=1740932475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Befriend...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've officially come to help the village to recover from its recent hardships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accomplish the locals' quests to gain their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/page_2.png?t=1740932475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trade...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you help a local, the more trades he propose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/page_3.png?t=1740932475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enrich...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tools are the engine of your economic growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/page_4.png?t=1740932475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hamlet is also a story. Learn more about what happened recently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/page_5.png?t=1740932475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>A cozy game in a cozy village. Make money and get the ruby.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Have fun !</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/capsule_small.png?t=1740932475\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3441200?t=1740932475","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740932475","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/84aa78296d1bdb5af3ef88368c76a3cc5f7a6fb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740932475","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/84aa78296d1bdb5af3ef88368c76a3cc5f7a6fb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740932475","categories":[{"descr